## Current Autopilot Strengths

- `full_default_harness_parity_proven` is documented with 29 closed default rows and 12 explicit outside-default provider rows.
- `antigravity_harness_parity_plus_proven` is documented with 30/30 scenarios passed and no open P0/P1 rows.
- Product chat now separates clean work-summary capsules from tracing/receipts.
- Agent Studio preserves Ask as direct model response and Agent as governed harness.
- Managed browser/computer sessions have compact preview, expanded observe view, Sandbox browser / Local browser / Desktop labels, Observe / Take over / Return control controls, and Waiting for user state.
- Retained shell status/input/terminate, browser state/session rows, memory read/search, screen actions, delegation, policy lease UX, hunk workflow, stop/cancel/recover, trajectory, signed replay, and provider decision rows are represented in the current Antigravity/default evidence.

